can show stale Perps data\n\n**High Severity**\n\n<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->\n`initForAddress` now nulls `initializedAddress` before `init()`, so the address-change path that used to `reset()` channels never runs. In-flight REST fallbacks are not cancelled and can push the previous account's positions, orders, or account state after the switch. At the same time, `handleBackgroundUpdate` drops every stream payload while `pendingInit` is set, including the new session's first WebSocket snapshots, so the cache stays empty and that stale REST write can win.\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\n\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: 266a9f0e-92a2-4df3-ad6a-9d7aafce43bf -->\n\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\nui/providers/perps/PerpsStreamManager.ts#L554-L629\nui/providers/perps/PerpsStreamManager.ts#L626-L629\nLOCATIONS END -->\n<details>\n<summary>Additional Locations (1)</summary>\n\n- [`ui/providers/perps/PerpsStreamManager.ts#L626-L629`](https://github.com/MetaMask/metamask-extension/blob/b762a63f39e40d06c94a5cd11616c9a01852c720/ui/providers/perps/PerpsStreamManager.ts#L626-L629)\n\n</details>\n\n<div><a href=\"https://cursor.com/open?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\"><img alt=\"Fix in Cursor\" width=\"115\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\"><img alt=\"Fix in Web\" width=\"99\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a></div>\n\n\n<su